{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118462","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118462/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118462/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118462/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118462","id":4246519114,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc79HL1K","number":118462,"title":"SMBPitchShift out-of-bounds read via negative FIFO index when parameters change","user":{"login":"rayamazaky","id":238893411,"node_id":"U_kgDODj05Yw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/238893411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky","html_url":"https://github.com/rayamazaky","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-12T04:28:07Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T09:17:15Z","closed_at":"2026-04-13T09:16:45Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.dev\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn `servers/audio/effects/audio_effect_pitch_shift.cpp:107`, the FIFO index can go negative when parameters change between calls:\n\n```cpp\noutdata[i*stride] = gOutFIFO[gRover - inFifoLatency];  // line 107\n```\n\n`gRover` is a persistent static variable initialized to 0 (line 50 of header). On the first call it's set to `inFifoLatency` (line 98). However, if `PitchShift()` is called again with different `fftFrameSize` or `osamp`, `gRover` retains its old value. If the new `inFifoLatency` exceeds `gRover`, the expression `gRover - inFifoLatency` produces a **negative index**, reading memory before `gOutFIFO`.\n\nThe `gRover == 0` guard (line 98) only triggers once; subsequent calls with changed parameters do not re-initialize `gRover`.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Use `AudioEffectPitchShift` with one FFT size.\n2. Change the FFT size at runtime (e.g., via `fft_size` property).\n3. Out-of-bounds read from negative FIFO index.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A — out-of-bounds access from stale static variable visible from source analysis.","closed_by":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118462/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118462/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}